sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Three-phase commit call sequence
    accDescr: The coordinator asks both shards to prepare and receives yes votes. It then sends Pre-commit and waits for acknowledgements from both shards before sending Commit.
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant A as Shard A
    participant B as Shard B

    C->>A: Prepare
    C->>B: Prepare
    A-->>C: Yes, ready
    B-->>C: Yes, ready
    Note over C,B: Both participants are prepared
    C->>A: Pre-commit
    C->>B: Pre-commit
    A-->>C: Ack
    B-->>C: Ack
    Note over C,B: Both acknowledge Pre-commit
    C->>A: Commit
    C->>B: Commit
    A-->>C: Committed
    B-->>C: Committed
